1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,015
Tie a loop of string to two pins and pull it tight with a pencil: you draw an ellipse.

2
00:00:06,015 --> 00:00:07,968
The two pins are the foci.

3
00:00:07,968 --> 00:00:15,377
However the pencil moves, the two distances add up to the same length, two a, the major axis.

